SCOPE

This licence covers the work authored in this repository: the server C#, the
Unity editor build scripts, the Python tooling, the PowerShell scripts and the
documentation.

It does NOT cover third-party content that lives here or is referenced by it:

  Eco game assets       Strange Loop Games'. This mod is built on their
                        TrailerTruckObject prefab and reuses their shipping
                        container art. Permitted for a free mod - see
                        LICENSES.md - but not ours to relicense.

  tools/RCC*.cs         Name- and GUID-matched stubs so prefabs bind to the
                        client's real Realistic Car Controller (BoneCracker
                        Games). No RCC implementation is reproduced, but the
                        names are theirs.

  tools/*.cs stubs      Identity stubs matching Eco client component names, so
                        the shipped prefab binds at runtime. Same position.

Read LICENSES.md before redistributing any part of this.
